<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 16px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0px;">We're delighted to announce that Flywire has enabled Google Pay and Apple Pay to streamline education payments for students and families around the world. Through this direct connection, international students and families can utilise Flywire to make their education payments via Google Pay or Apple Pay in their currency of choice (where supported by Google/Apple).</p> </td> 
