<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Get ready for an unforgettable experience at Flywire’s <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/annual-conference-awards-ceremony-2025?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Annual Conference &amp; Awards Ceremony</u></strong></span></a> on 4th-5th March in Windsor - which includes a spectacular black-tie awards ceremony to celebrate the sector’s outstanding achievements!</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Join 200+ higher education professionals for two incredible days filled with engaging keynotes, dynamic think tank sessions, interactive workshops, inspiring case studies, and thought-provoking panel discussions.</p> </td> 
