<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Flywire invites you to join our quarterly Community Meetings, with a refreshed format for our interactive peer-to-peer meetings where you’ll have the opportunity to discuss the latest trends, hot topics, raise questions and share best practices. Our Community Meetings will be around the following topics:</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><strong>International Payments Community Meetings</strong> (previously called Nigeria Coffee Chat). Next one: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://t.yesware.com/tt/85c45958e1017762e79a259b9435ea0f3f2adf6f/24445c4ec9f45afe39906ad5e6c4a4cf/a1dea74d33e02f9acded46fd16f84947/flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEucu6srjMoGdQzIAV3A1GikdruICFOJYux?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>6th February</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li><strong>Tribal Community Meetings</strong> - NEW for 2025: Join Flywire's inaugural Tribal Community Meeting hosted by Oliver Mussett, Flywire's Senior Strategic Partner Manager who oversees Flywire's partnership with Tribal, and has recently joined Flywire following eight years working for Tribal. Next one: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://t.yesware.com/tt/85c45958e1017762e79a259b9435ea0f3f2adf6f/24445c4ec9f45afe39906ad5e6c4a4cf/a97f52c27b6b8559dc2025f50b18280e/flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYrdOivqz4vHdVEfhk_8QhHkJEoqlT9Geuc?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>13th February</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li><strong>Payment Security Community Meetings.</strong> Next one: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://t.yesware.com/tt/85c45958e1017762e79a259b9435ea0f3f2adf6f/24445c4ec9f45afe39906ad5e6c4a4cf/772468b7ed3dd6b0f8632589c2a862a0/flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqcu2rpjgvH9BYLSa4NmVqJDS2sHG0Wo_m?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>26th March</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li><strong>AML Community Meetings</strong> (previously called AML Special Interest Group). Next one: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0pd-qqqjwpH9yVZKSNku1ot8LS2EpW8zXu?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;mkt_tok=MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAGX2szJQ-Lw0oqavpz-PsYwoOwKCXbHwD0nQ5mVRjFki69ZXAYbt-gRw7Wn_UnBiibgU3RjMudTw1878Wz-2X0&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>29th April</u></strong></span></a></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">We hope to see you there, alongside other like-minded peers!</p> </td> 
</tr> 
